{"meta":{"ui":"question_flow","model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","form":"notation","turn":"generate","prompt":"Help me pick a laptop with a short question flow, one question at a time: what I use it for, then a second question that depends on that answer, then budget. Show progress, let me go back, and end on one recommendation with the reasons and a start over button.","text":"state step=1\nstate use=\"\"\nstate detail=\"\"\nstate budget=500\n\nCard w:390 gap:16\n  Row between middle\n    Text.caption \"Step {min(step,3)} of 3\"\n    if step<4\n      Text.caption \"{round(step/3*100)}%\"\n  Progress =progress visible:=step<4\n  if step==1\n    Text.title \"What will you use it for?\"\n    Column gap:8\n      ChoiceChip \"School and everyday tasks\" selected:=use==\"school\" -> use=\"school\"; detail=\"\"\n      ChoiceChip \"Work and office\" selected:=use==\"work\" -> use=\"work\"; detail=\"\"\n      ChoiceChip \"Gaming\" selected:=use==\"gaming\" -> use=\"gaming\"; detail=\"\"\n      ChoiceChip \"Creative work\" selected:=use==\"creative\" -> use=\"creative\"; detail=\"\"\n  if step==2\n    if use==\"school\"\n      Text.title \"What matters most for school?\"\n      Column gap:8\n        ChoiceChip \"Light and portable\" selected:=detail==\"portable\" -> detail=\"portable\"\n        ChoiceChip \"Long battery life\" selected:=detail==\"battery\" -> detail=\"battery\"\n        ChoiceChip \"Lowest price\" selected:=detail==\"cheap\" -> detail=\"cheap\"\n    if use==\"work\"\n      Text.title \"What is your work like?\"\n      Column gap:8\n        ChoiceChip \"Travel often\" selected:=detail==\"travel\" -> detail=\"travel\"\n        ChoiceChip \"Mostly at a desk\" selected:=detail==\"desk\" -> detail=\"desk\"\n        ChoiceChip \"Heavy multitasking\" selected:=detail==\"multi\" -> detail=\"multi\"\n    if use==\"gaming\"\n      Text.title \"What kind of games do you play?\"\n      Column gap:8\n        ChoiceChip \"Esports and light games\" selected:=detail==\"esports\" -